# Components

- One section or UI piece per folder. Keep page composition in `src/app/page.tsx` or a section component.
- Repeated controls use `src/components/ui/` (`Button`, `Icon`, `Stars`, `Eyebrow`). Do not copy their markup.
- Use `next/image` for raster photos, with `priority` only on the hero. SVG icons go through `Icon`.
- Buttons and nav links must go somewhere real (`/programs`, `/signin`, `/#programs`). Do not leave inert controls.
- Semantic headings, labels, and alt text stay in the markup. Motion must not be the only way to read the content.
- Interior pages reuse `PageIntro`. Do not invent a new layout system for them.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<img src="/assets/icons/arrow-a.svg" alt="" />

// ✅ GOOD
<Icon src="/assets/icons/arrow-a.svg" width={20} height={20} />
```
